---
// Short landing beat for the local/private story. Full text lives at /privacy.
---

<section id="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">On your Mac</p>
    <h2 id="privacy-heading">Nothing leaves unless you send it</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Detection, config and logs stay in your home directory. There is no account, no
      Chipcolate cloud, and no analytics SDK. The only network paths are ones you configure.
    </p>

    <ul class="points">
      <li class="point card">
        <p class="mono label">Local only</p>
        <p>
          Sensor samples are processed on-device. Optional scope telemetry is a local socket
          stream to the menu bar app, off when nobody is watching.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="point card">
        <p class="mono label">No account</p>
        <p>
          No sign-up, no profile, no server we operate. Uninstall and delete a few paths
          under <code>~/Library</code> and it is gone.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="point card">
        <p class="mono label">Your actions</p>
        <p>
          Sounds stay local. Webhooks and commands only talk to endpoints or programs
          <em>you</em> set — never to us by default.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="more">
      <a href="/privacy">Full privacy policy</a>
      <span class="sep mono" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/privacy#questions">Questions via GitHub Issues</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .points {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 240px), 1fr));
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .point {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.35rem 1.4rem 1.45rem;
  }

  .point p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .label {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .point code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  .more {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .more a {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .sep {
    margin-inline: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
